<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CACI cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CACI cut to neutral.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>NatWest Securities said it downgraded CACI International Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- said cut the 12-month price target to $18 from $23.</p>
<p>-- said trimmed the fiscal 1997 earnings estimate to $0.92 a share from $1.06 a share and cut the fiscal 1998 estimate to $1.01 a share from $1.22 a share.</p>
<p>-- On Friday, CACI said it expects to report fourth quarter sales of $71 million and earnings of $1.6 million or $0.14 a share, which falls below the First Call consensus estimate of $0.27 a share.</p>
<p>-- CACI lost 3-3/4 to 15-1/2.</p>
